  "description": "MiniLM encoder package for DemaConsulting.WordSense: an int8 ONNX all-MiniLM-L6-v2 encoder composed with the built-in model of the core package. It scores the fine senses of the trained lemmas with weights embedded in the package and answers every other ambiguous word through the built-in statistical model. The roughly 22 MiB model is downloaded once on first use and verified by SHA-256.",
